      "desc": "Use this Blueprint at the Smart Workshop to unlock the recipe for this item. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\n\nItem Effect: Increases Energy or Adrenaline Generation Rate by <color=#2BAD00>20%</color>. When an Agent uses an <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, all squad members deal <color=#2BAD00>30%</color> more DMG, and that <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color> ignores <color=#2BAD00>10%</color> of the target's RES. Lasts <color=#2BAD00>15</color>s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
